{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:25 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f4ebb6cb44b47025670f480c7575660/2026-10/tm.jpg\"/>\n<p>屯門發生燒炭命案。今日（18日）下午2時許，警方接獲一名38歲姓張女子報案，指其父母倒卧屯門山景邨景榮樓的寓所內，奄奄一息，救援人員趕到現場，發現二人已陷昏迷，旁邊有一盤已燒過的炭，隨即將他們送往屯門醫院搶救，可惜最終不治。</p>\n<p>據了解，男事主姓張（72歲），女事主姓謝（69歲），二人拍拖半世紀育有一女，多年來沒有註冊結婚，最近女事主確診患上柏金遜症。今日，張女收到親友通知，指父母失聯多時，於是上門了解，詎料見到二人倒卧廁所，旁邊有一盤燒，送院搶救後返魂乏術。</p>\n<p>警方於現場進行調查，並檢獲一封遺書，內容提及兩人因不堪疾病痛苦煎熬，案件暫列「送院時死亡」，交由屯門警區重案組跟進。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65741c05397ef1c7e59487b5f63ee393/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_10_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方到場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf03dc8eff03f929e65bfcd2a688a8f3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨景榮樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34f581674b6c675d4b1000b5ee248ca5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_09_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/715ca26c026b34f64c6587d1e0fba6c9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_09.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cb5542e7091ee494366e023526e2832/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_11_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為屯門山景邨景榮樓。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/426cbf90ab03c244201355df82037cdf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_16_12_36.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T14:39:32.649794+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:57:48.516729+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:15.078700+00:00","content_hash":"70194374c8458962fb684e5ce14d7596822de993ee5a13bca0ccf090df58d67b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}